Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1030-1031] Onigashima 38 - Soldier of Science.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young Master Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The armory lies at the deepest level\Nof the underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:41.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I reach it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must slow the island's advance,\Neven if only slightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis trying, but I shall persevere!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show your guts!\NMomonosuke, you can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can still do more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must create more\NFlame Clouds...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stronger Flame Clouds,\Nmighty enough to rival Kaido's!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall not allow Onigashima\Nto reach the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar...\NYour ability's awakened, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to it yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd use it if it meant the difference between life and death,\Nbut it drains the hell outta my stamina...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could end up being\Na critical misstep in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we ain't getting\Nanywhere like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better be ready to back me up\Nwith your ace in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About the great armory\Nat the lowest level of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:19.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weapons I ordered made,\Nalong with a massive stockpile of ammunition!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's going to be a\Nhuge, huge, huge explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set it alight, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:32.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set it alight, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blow everything to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the abyss, to the abyss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we shall host the greatest finale\Nat the Kurozumi Clan's graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is over!\NIt all ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tire of dealing with utter fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to me at once, Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flower Shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mere trifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Earlobe Crackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall lay waste to our lord's enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja think of nothing\Nbut their duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us escape from here!\NEscape, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before Onigashima is\Nengulfed in flames and explodes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A war between pirates\Nis none of our business!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naughty brats like you\Nneed to be taught a harsh lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sovereignty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got one of you, didn't I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those two are keeping Big Mom at bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better be ready to back me up\Nwith your ace in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Room:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make this\Nreal painful for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna give ya\Nthe worst pain of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The penetration itself is harmless...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But K-Room...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...generates an internal shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shock Wille!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama! You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you,\Nyou damn runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make you more attractive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assign!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm stuck to Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!\NDid you just turn me into a magnet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More, more...\NThere's more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The towers' steel beams are gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Release it, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give me orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Clash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She was crushed\Nby those steel beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even Big Mom can...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's my ace in the hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How d'ya like that,\Nhag from hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the awakened\NMagnet-Magnet Fruit power...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lets you turn anything\Ninto a magnet, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long does it last?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell should I show you\Nwhat's in my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's back on her feeeet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:10:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NThat's her Soul Pocus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Life or oshiruko"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got some oshiruko,\Ndon't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope, we dumped it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't got the soup,\Nshe's gonna steal our lifespans!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:11:00.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I give you life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna use\Na year's worth of my lifespan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no other way\Nto make myself stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's getting bigger...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, the bigger she is,\Nthe better for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kick her ass or dice it,\Nit's gonna be a pain either way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?!\NShe's gigantified!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That, and the castle's ablaze!\NIt doesn't get more dangerous than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Performance Floor's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a living hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't felt this much pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...in decades...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and "Captain" Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it now,\Nyou've all come for my throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I gotta\Nput down this monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:33.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...just so I can\Nlearn more about history!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it all ya got,\Ndon't hold anything back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're yankin' her off that throne,\Neven if it kills us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:45.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then claim it, if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prove you're worthy of\Nbeing an Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahead of me lies\Nnothing but soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must circumvent them\Nby way of the sacred cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:09.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait a sec!\NYou lost it or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't got any reason to be slicing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arguing is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already figured out\Nhow your attacks work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not going to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're bluffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your lines of attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are hard to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they are there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Activation requires the target's hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the scope is your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give it all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Won't make any difference anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're screwed,\N'cause I've got three of the Numbers here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To fulfill my duty to Straw Hat,\NI need to put you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake! Apoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is one of the Flying Six\Nand an informant doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I oughta be asking you that, Young Master!\NWhat're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Nfighting against Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to reach the armory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!\NHe's one of Kaido's enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake, that idiot...\NHe's useless anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:52.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about we swap, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:53.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake, let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, wait a sec,\NYoung Master Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:16:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have I got some good news for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,\NI do not have time for!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have severed ties with Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not think of me as your ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!\NThen we really gotta talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I haven't the time\Nto chat with you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make way, Animal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not bar my path!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yamato! D...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you will not move...\NI shall make you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not even think you can stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make way at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've broken off from\Nthe Animal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything\Nto do with Kaido, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?! Really, now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apologies, Drake...\NBut I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Off I go...\NUntil then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:03.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima and\Nthe Flower Capital are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Every last one of 'em...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of 'em are followin' my beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta get Yamato on my side somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Fuga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fuga...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where ya going, Fuga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:18:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's stop them!\NFollow me, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young Master Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away, Apoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run, Baron Corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd rather you leave them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Minks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Baron Corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's be off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shan't let their\Nsacrifice be in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For them to defeat\Nthe Minks so handily...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:22.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they, truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're a Cipher Pol unit, CP-0.\NThey were at Dress Rosa...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol?! The intelligence bureau\Nworking directly for the Government, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are they here\Non Onigashima, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I know is, the situation\Ncan't possibly get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of all the elements of CP-0,\Nthe top-ranking unit in Cipher Pol,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the masked agents are exceptions\Namong the exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you'll allow me, Robin-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Up and away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you go, Chuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, you must help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judge once said...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am just a geisha,\Nbrought in from the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With the power of science...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...he'd create a warrior\Nwith an unfeeling heart of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Germa blood you've got in ya has gotta\Nbe goin' crazy right now, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...human, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay, m'lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding!\NWho would do such a thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you do this\Nto such a young girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, please!\NThere's been a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're one of\NWano's soldiers, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:55.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this to your own?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't, though!\NPlease, just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough of your lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some was running from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave here at once!\NThis is our hiding place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.42,0:22:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've some nerve, raising your hand\Nagainst a harmless woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be true! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.68,0:22:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell with cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Begone already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.40,0:22:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd never harm a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where've you been?\NI thought the Pleasure Hall was closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.93,0:23:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! That's the last thing I'd do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I lay a hand on...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knocking a woman\Nunconscious like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything about all of you\Ngoes against what I stand for!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna end up like them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My body isn't tingling anymore...\NHave I stopped mutating?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was caught up\Nin my thoughts back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the moment I noticed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...she was flying and bleeding...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.55,0:23:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and looking at me,\Nlike she'd seen a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.47,0:23:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which do you want over the other...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The human version of me,\Ntotally unreliable and helpless...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...when faced with a female enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.57,0:24:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or the cruel, heartless warrior of science\Nable to beat up a monster like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Able to bring you the head of\Nanybody you want when ordered?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.13,0:24:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which version of me\Ncan help the Pirate King?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.55,0:24:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:34.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.55,0:24:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.85,0:24:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dunno what's gonna happen, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.35,0:24:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That the Germa suit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:53.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably all because I wore this...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that the "science" I've had\Nin my body since birth awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't do a damn thing\Nabout it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Accept it!\NShow me Germa's science!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "science" stops here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.93,0:25:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't become the Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...refuse to be a Germa slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, right down the drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me your transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.17,0:25:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farewell...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Women's bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.63,0:25:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...no matter what happens after!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...\NRing, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.73,0:26:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.15,0:26:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have I had a Transponder Snail\Non me the whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's calling me\Nat a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.87,0:26:27.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I snuck one into your waistband.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In case you found yourself\Ndying in a ditch or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumbass cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.96,0:26:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit buggin' me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.72,0:26:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This won't take long, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.85,0:26:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna win against\Nthe Animal Kingdom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure! That goes without sayin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.57,0:26:58.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But after the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I've lost my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.58,0:27:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gotta kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to kill you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.61,0:27:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dunno what your deal is,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now I got something\Nto look forward to!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,don't die until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.88,0:27:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.29,0:27:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.30,0:28:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell'd you go?!\NThat more science of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son of Judge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, you don't wanna\Nadd fuel to the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's already blazing hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.91,0:28:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell Memories!
